---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Terms & Conditions - Cóndor Expeditions"
	description="Terms and conditions for using the site and booking services with Cóndor Expeditions."
	lang="en"
>
	<section class="pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-12 bg-negro text-white">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-4">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
			<p class="text-lg text-white/70">Last updated: August 2026</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section-padding bg-background">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">1. Purpose</h2>
				<p>These terms govern the use of the Cóndor Expeditions website and the booking of tour services. By making a reservation, the client accepts these terms in full.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">2. Bookings &amp; confirmation</h2>
				<p>All bookings are subject to availability and are considered confirmed once the corresponding deposit is received. Prices are stated in US dollars (USD) and include the services listed on each tour page.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">3. Cancellations</h2>
				<p>Cancellations more than 72 hours in advance: full deposit refund. Less than 72 hours or no-show: no refund. Multi-day tours have specific policies communicated at booking time.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">4. Liability</h2>
				<p>Cóndor Expeditions operates with certified guides and activity insurance. Clients declare they are physically fit for the booked activity and must follow the guide's instructions at all times. Itineraries may change due to weather or safety reasons.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">5. Contact</h2>
				<p>For any questions about these terms, reach us via our <a href="/en/contacto" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
